<!-- ============ 试味反馈 ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <h2 class="section-title">试味反馈</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">出锅后让身边朋友试吃，这是最真实的检验。摆摊能不能卖，群众说了算。</p>

  <div class="feedback-grid">
    <div class="feedback-item">
      <div class="emoji">👍</div>
      <div class="quote">"行，可以。辣，甜，不咸。摆摊行。"</div>
      <div class="author">— 朋友1</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feedback-item">
      <div class="emoji">🤔</div>
      <div class="quote">"味稍微有点淡，比外面卖的稍微差一点"</div>
      <div class="author">— 朋友2</div>
    </div>
